class=\"path1\"></span><span class=\"path2\"></span><span class=\"path3\"></span><span class=\"path4\"></span></i> View Source</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Rendered HTML view -->\n<div id=\"emailPreviewRendered\" style=\"min-height:400px; max-height:600px; overflow-y:auto;\">\n<!-- \u2705 FIX 1: Added \"allow-scripts\" to sandbox -->\n<!-- OLD: sandbox=\"allow-same-origin\" -->\n<!-- Without allow-scripts, the browser blocks ANY script inside the iframe,\n                             including inline <style> tags being applied, causing the email to render\n                             unstyled and throwing \"Blocked script execution\" in the console. -->\n<iframe id=\"emailPreviewIframe\" sandbox=\"allow-same-origin allow-scripts\" srcdoc='&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;\n&lt;html&gt;\n&lt;head&gt;\n&lt;meta charset=\"utf-8\"&gt;\n&lt;meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\"&gt;\n&lt;style&gt;\n  body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; background-color: #f4f4f4; }\n  .email-container { background-color: #ffffff; padding: 30px; border-radius: 8px; }\n  .content-section { margin: 20px 0; word-break: break-word; }\n  a { color: #007bff; }\n&lt;/style&gt;\n&lt;/head&gt;\n&lt;body&gt;\n  &lt;div class=\"email-container\"&gt;\n    &lt;div style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:30px;\"&gt;\n                         &lt;img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/likwid\\u002Dmedia/email_templates/logos/Logo_Typography_1.png?X\\u002DGoog\\u002DAlgorithm\\u003DGOOG4\\u002DRSA\\u002DSHA256\\u0026X\\u002DGoog\\u002DCredential\\u003Dlikwid\\u002Dapp\\u002Dalpha%40appspot.gserviceaccount.com%2F20260508%2Fauto%2Fstorage%2Fgoog4_request\\u0026X\\u002DGoog\\u002DDate\\u003D20260508T154325Z\\u0026X\\u002DGoog\\u002DExpires\\u003D86400\\u0026X\\u002DGoog\\u002DSignedHeaders\\u003Dhost\\u0026X\\u002DGoog\\u002DSignature\\\" alt=\"Logo\" style=\"max-width:200px; height:auto;\" /&gt;\n                       &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;div class=\"content-section\"&gt;78% of enterprises are already using AI. The gap is widening.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;They\\u0027re starting with procurement and inventory.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Why? Because that\\u0027s where the money is. Every order placed on gut feel, every overstock sitting in a warehouse, every vendor chosen without data\\u002D that\\u0027s working capital silently draining out of your business.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The enterprises winning right now have one thing in common: they stopped guessing and started planning with AI.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We just published our AI Adoption in Procurement Report 2026, a deep dive into how inventory\\u002Dheavy businesses are using AI to plan smarter, procure faster, and free up working capital that was previously stuck.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;It\\u0027s free. No form. Just data.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Likwid.AI\\u002D  AI\\u002Dnative Procurement \\u0026 Inventory Platform&lt;br&gt;Backed by Indian School of Business \u00b7 Powered by Google Cloud&lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;div style=\"text-align:center; margin-top:30px; padding-top:20px; border-top:1px solid #eee;\"&gt;\n                         &lt;a href=\"https://www.likwid.co.in/ai\\u002Dadoption\\u002Din\\u002Dmanufacturing\\u002Dreport\\u002D2026\" style=\"display:inline-block; background-color:#007bff; color:#fff; padding:12px 30px; text-decoration:none; border-radius:5px; font-weight:bold;\"&gt;Know More&lt;/a&gt;\n                       &lt;/div&gt;\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/body&gt;\n&lt;/html&gt;' style=\"width: 100%; min-height: 400px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial; display: block; height: 580px;\">\n</iframe>\n</div>\n<!-- Raw source view (hidden by default) -->\n<div id=\"emailPreviewSource\" style=\"display:none; min-height:400px; max-height:600px; overflow-y:auto;\">\n<pre class=\"p-7 m-0 fs-7 text-gray-700\" id=\"emailPreviewSourceText\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap; word-break:break-all; background:#f8f9fa;\">78% of enterprises are already using AI. The gap is widening.\\u000D\\u000A\\u000D\\u000AThey\\u0027re starting with procurement and inventory.\\u000D\\u000A\\u000D\\u000AWhy? Because that\\u0027s where the money is. Every order placed on gut feel, every overstock sitting in a warehouse, every vendor chosen without data\\u002D that\\u0027s working capital silently draining out of your business.\\u000D\\u000A\\u000D\\u000AThe enterprises winning right now have one thing in common: they stopped guessing and started planning with AI.\\u000D\\u000A\\u000D\\u000AWe just published our AI Adoption in Procurement Report 2026, a deep dive into how inventory\\u002Dheavy businesses are using AI to plan smarter, procure faster, and free up working capital that was previously stuck.\\u000D\\u000A\\u000D\\u000AIt\\u0027s free. No form. Just data.\\u000D\\u000A\\u000D\\u000ALikwid.AI\\u002D  AI\\u002Dnative Procurement \\u0026 Inventory Platform\\u000D\\u000ABacked by Indian School of Business \u00b7 Powered by Google Cloud</pre>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"modal-footer border-top border-gray-200 py-4\">\n<button class=\"btn btn-light\" data-bs-dismiss=\"modal\" type=\"button\">Close</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
